{"articleNo":"193841","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=193841&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[근로]국가근로(교외) 모집 안내(대구교육연수원)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.06.18","hit":"3559","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">대구광역시교육연수원에서 하계방학 동안 근무할 국가근로 학생을 모집합니다.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">*2018-1학기 국가근로 자격을 갖춘 재학생만 해당됨을 알려드립니다.*</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">* 선발 완료하였습니다.(선발된 학생들에게 개별 연락함)</span></span></span></span></span></p></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">1. 근로지 내역</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 가. 근로지 :&nbsp;대구광역시교육연수원 본원 (대구 감삼동)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [필요시 변경 될 수 있음]</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 나. 근로 업무 : 교원연수 업무 지원</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 다. 근로 기간 : 1학기 하계방학 중 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; [대구광역시교육연수원과 협의 후 진행, 예산에 따라 축소 가능]</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2. 신청 관련</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;신청기간 : ~2018.6.19.(화) 18시</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;신청방법</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학과/학번/성명/연락처 기재</span></span></p></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 이메일(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"mailto:dala0608@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u>dala0608@kumoh.ac.kr</u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">) 신청</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">3. 선정 관련</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 가. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\">선정 인원 : 3명</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;선정 기준&nbsp; : 학기 초과 제외</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 소득순위 : 1순위&gt;2순위&gt;3순위&gt;</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;소득순위가 동일할 경우 직전학기 성적</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 다. 선정 결과 : 6.20.(수)에 개별 연락</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
